{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: a client that announces 0x8F6 receives its overflow slots in 0x8F7",
  "contract": [
    "With Quests.LogSize 64 and 30 quests, slots 25-29 hold overflow quests. After the client sends HELLO (0x8F6, version 1, 64 slots) the server sends one full 0x8F7 snapshot with log size 64 and five entries, the first for slot 25 holding the 26th quest, Kobold Camp Cleanup (7). A Kobold Vermin (6) kill then sends a 0x8F7 delta (not full) for slot 25 carrying the kill."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "quest_log_size": 64,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 20
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
